{"symbol":"ADTECH","yahoo":"ADTECH.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Adtech Systems Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","website":"https://www.adtechindia.com","about":"Adtech Systems Limited provides a range of electronic security solutions in India. The company offers electronic article surveillance systems; retail display security solutions; point of sale solutions and cases; digital locks; RFID solutions; electronic shelf labeling solutions; and footfall counting systems. It also engages in the design and manufacture of IP surveillance solutions; CCTV cellular routers; sensors and gateways; intelligent IP video systems; video management system software; enterprise management servers and the enterprise manager software; network video recorders; live video monitoring stations; IP cameras; storage devices; video surveillance accessories; and cloud services. In addition, the company offers building management systems; and offers smart home solutions, including smart hubs, smart lighting, smart sensors, smart locks, and smart thermostats. The company was incorporated in 1990 and is based in Thiruvananthapuram, India. Adtech Systems Limited is a subsidiary of Tops Security Limited.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:06:17+00:00","quote":{"price":45.02,"prevClose":48.3,"marketCap":53.64,"high52":90.95,"low52":43.05,"pe":24.07,"bookValue":null,"dividendRate":1.1,"roe":null,"shares":1.1914,"insiders":84.72,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-06-19","2024-06-20","2024-06-21","2024-06-24","2024-06-25","2024-06-26","2024-06-27","2024-06-28","2024-07-01","2024-07-02","2024-07-03","2024-07-04","2024-07-05","2024-07-08","2024-07-09","2024-07-10","2024-07-11","2024-07-12","2024-07-15","2024-07-16","2024-07-18","2024-07-19","2024-07-22","2024-07-23","2024-07-24","2024-07-25","2024-07-26","2024-07-29","2024-07-30","2024-07-31","2024-08-01","2024-08-02","2024-08-05","2024-08-06","2024-08-07","2024-08-08","2024-08-09","2024-08-12","2024-08-13